  "description": "Reid Pulse ST | Step-through urban eBike\nMake every journey easier with the Reid Bikes Pulse ST, a sleek step-through urban hybrid eBike designed for comfortable, effortless commuting and everyday riding. With its low-step frame, modern styling and practical features, the Pulse ST from Reid Bikes is ideal for commuting, errands, city rides and weekend adventures.\nBuilt around a lightweight 6061 alloy step-through frame with internal cable routing and an integrated downtube battery, the Pulse ST combines easy mounting and dismounting with a clean, modern design. The Ananda M131 250W rear hub motor provides smooth, natural-feeling assistance, while the 7-speed Shimano drivetrain makes hills and busy city streets easier to navigate.\nThe 36V 11.6Ah (417Wh) battery provides dependable range for everyday journeys, while the Bluetooth-enabled Ananda D19 display connects to your smartphone for convenient ride data and navigation.\nDesigned for all-day comfort, the Reid Bikes Pulse ST features Shimano hydraulic disc brakes for confident stopping, wide high-volume tyres to smooth out uneven surfaces, and an adjustable alloy stem for a comfortable, upright riding position. Ergonomic grips and a plush comfort saddle add further comfort for longer rides.\nPractical accessories make the Reid Bikes Pulse ST ready for everyday life, including full mudguards, a rear rack for shopping or work essentials, and a sturdy kickstand. Whether you're commuting to work, heading to the shops or exploring the city, the Reid Pulse ST makes every ride more comfortable and enjoyable.\nWho is the Reid Bikes Pulse ST eBike for?\nThe Reid Pulse ST eBike is ideal for:\n\nRiders looking for an easy-to-mount step-through electric bike\nDaily commuters wanting a comfortable urban eBike\nCity riding, errands and trips to work\nRiders who want smooth electric assistance on hills and longer journeys\nThose looking for practical features including mudguards and a rear rack\nWeekend rides and everyday cycling adventures\n\nFind the right fit\nChoosing the right bike size helps you ride comfortably, confidently and safely. Use our Bike Size Guide by clicking the tab above to find the right Reid bike based on your height and riding needs.",
